                    'OF THAT, BECAUSE PEG CANNOT SEE CASH AND CANNOT SEE DEBT. || 💡 SO WHERE IS PEG ACTUALLY USEFUL? '
                    'AS A SANITY CHECK ON A COMPANY YOU HAVE ALREADY UNDERWRITTEN: STEADILY PROFITABLE, NOT CYCLICAL, '
                    'WITH A GROWTH RATE THAT HAS BEEN STABLE FOR SEVERAL YEARS. On such a company a PEG above 2 is a '
                    'warning worth taking seriously. ⚠️ IT IS NEVER A SCREEN, IT IS NEVER A RANKING, AND IT IS NEVER '
                    'USABLE ON A LOSS-MAKER, A CYCLICAL AT ITS PEAK, OR A COMPANY WHOSE CASH FLOW DISAGREES WITH ITS '
                    'EARNINGS. THAT EXCLUDES AT LEAST FOUR OF THE TEN NAMES ON THIS SLIDE. || 📌 THE ORDER THIS BOARD '
                    'USES AND WILL KEEP USING: FIRST, DOES IT MAKE MONEY UNDER GAAP. SECOND, DOES THE CASH AGREE WITH '
